Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.88,0:02:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)\pos(960,479)}4 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:08.92,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1654,468)\fad(300,300)}Fallen Moon Village\NPlanet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.64,0:02:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,If someone breathes the immortal mist on Qilian Peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.80,0:02:11.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,they'll be healthy for 10 years !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:11.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:14.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,have I ever been sick in all these years ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.36,0:02:13.96,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(327,572)\fad(300,000)}Zhou Family's youngest son\NVillager of Fallen Moon Village
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:16.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,How amazing !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.56,0:02:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Ping,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,if only you could take a breath of that mist...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.52,0:02:22.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1378,419)}Wang Ping
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:24.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll have my father take me to the peak to breathe the immortal mist !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,4 years ago, the heavens became angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the immortal mist disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,All of you listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.56,0:02:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's better to learn martial arts together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,When we grow up, we can travel the martial world with our swords !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:39.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Travel the martial world with our swords !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,come back for dinner !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:43.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,stop playing !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.32,0:02:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will continue today's tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,after dinner !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.08,0:02:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.80,0:02:50.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:02:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If someone breathes the immortal mist on Qilian Peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,they'll be healthy for 10 years !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.44,0:03:01.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:04.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,were you having a martial arts tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,with my son again ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Uncle Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:10.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(342,484)}Zhou Dahan\NVillager of Fallen Moon Village
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:09.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're handsome and polite,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:11.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are indeed the child of a craftsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,take me to your father to have some furniture made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle Zhou is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:25.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:26.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,my son is getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,His house
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,is missing a set of furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll need to trouble you, Brother Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,come back in 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,No problem !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,He hunted such a big deer !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:45.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The medicine is very bitter...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,are there really Immortals on Qilian Peak ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:55.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Drink it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,the medicine must be drunk while hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:06.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:09.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,when can Ping'er stop drinking this medicine ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Liu Mei's medicine, along with my thunder Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.48,0:04:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,are slowly unraveling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,After 4 years of gentle nurturing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,the resentment has mostly faded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.60,0:04:34.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,On the outside, he appears no different from an ordinary child
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:37.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,but if the treatment is interrupted, he will revert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems it will still take a long time to completely heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,His past is severed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.16,0:04:46.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,he has no memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:48.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,For him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is a new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,4 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fallen Moon Village is very similar to my hometown...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,If back then, I had become an ordinary carpenter
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,as my father wished,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,would my life really have been like this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:23.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I finally found the thing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,you asked me to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,With Celestial Ascension Fruits of the Northern Domain of Allheaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:29.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,let alone a giant beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,if a demon dragon swallowed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:34.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would be unconscious for 100 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:37.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 17 families of the Northern Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,are always wherever traces of this fruit appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.56,0:05:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,With my meager cultivation level,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:48.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is the most I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:52.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can go get the rest yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just a transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:05:59.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,After you pass away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:01.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will take your ashes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,back to Planet Dark Moon in the Alliance Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and bury them in the village at the foot of Heaven Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.60,0:06:08.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is Grandpa Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Grandpa Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.60,0:06:34.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,He called me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:40.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful fruit !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:43.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fruits flew away !?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:47.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can do magic ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,These things are not for a child like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:54.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can they be eaten ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:58.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's for the big beasts in the mountains that don't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Big beasts ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,How big ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bigger than the Old Yellow Ox at the village entrance ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And why don't they sleep ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will eating these fruits make them dream ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:08.47,Sub,,0,0,0,, Are you going to let him keep asking questions like this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:08.47,Third,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, have you ever seen them dream ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's rare to see you at a loss like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:17.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This child truly is endearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:23.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,He has only 15 years of lifespan left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:28.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now at the end of his life, he has no one to turn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:31.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is also a kind of karma for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:32.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.96,0:07:35.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's an empty house next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind this rustic village,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,then please stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really !?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er likes Grandpa Sun !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun, please stay !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please stay, Grandpa Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never imagined that I, Sun Tai, after my life of wandering,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:56.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,would still find a place to settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Awesome !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.76,0:08:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun is staying !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:02.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,hurry up !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me a story about the big beasts !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:13.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)\pos(960,478)}5 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little rascal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,why don't you spend some time with your father
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,instead of coming over to see me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aunt Zhang has come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here to play matchmaker again ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look, Grandpa Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the past 3 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aunt Zhang has come exactly 12 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:37.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why do all the aunts of the village
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,want a bite of my father
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,as if he were a piece of sweet cake ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang, look at this !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,These stitchings, the thoughtfulness...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:51.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Zhao Family's daughter stayed up several nights for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,She said that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,once married, she would treat Ping'er as her own child !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if you don't think of yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need to think of your child !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,He can't continue without a mother's love forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have no such intention for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, my good brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's been 9 years since you brought Ping'er to our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then I was still a young unmarried girl
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:21.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and now my own child is running all over the village !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,A house without a woman in it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn't feel like a home !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:25.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I right,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The child is hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's stop this matter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:36.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guess I wasted my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you ever change your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,make sure you come to me first !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,This little Ping'er truly has
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,quite a temper growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:52.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,He got that from his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is among the gentlest in our village !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:56.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,why would so many young ladies come to visit him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:07.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't overthink it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aunt Zhang is just being kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Er Hu's got a stepmother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:16.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,he doesn't get enough to eat
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and gets scolded all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take your medicine first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er will stay with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:29.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,When Ping'er grows up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you into your old age
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,and let you enjoy a good life !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.04,0:10:43.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I ran much faster today than yesterday, didn't I ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.56,0:10:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:48.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you plan to let this child cultivate the Dao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,With your cultivation level,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:53.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's sure to have a smooth path
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and will have an advantage over even the best cultivation families.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I named him Ping
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:01.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,because I wish for him to live an ordinary, peaceful life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not let him cultivate the Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,In his lifetime, I will never let him experience
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,the cruelty and the dangers of the cultivation world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this child was born very talented...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:14.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not let him cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:16.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't ever
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,mention this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why exactly ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems like he is hiding something...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's time to take your medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:40.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,But a mortal's lifetime will go by quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:45.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,A short lifespan of only a few dozen years...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,what did you want to show me today ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:57.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will let you witness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:12:00.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,the secret art of my sect that roams the sea of stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:02.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:04.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you an Immortal !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:07.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man started cultivating at 7
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and was revered as the Head Elder for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, I pass on to you our sect's secret technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.16,0:12:15.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Pulse Fixing Art !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:20.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a Corpse Puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Corpse Puppet ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:23.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:27.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an avatar that can fight thousands of enemies for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This big guy is a bit scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,A cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,controls Life and Death,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and defies the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your illness and lifespan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,can both be rewritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:51.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you cultivate,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will no longer have to suffer in this frail mortal body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will be immune to heat and cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:00.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and free from all sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:04.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,No... no...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promised Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I will never cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:08.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you and I don't speak of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:10.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er can't lie to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.88,0:13:14.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't make Dad sad !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like your father...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,stubborn to the bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.40,0:13:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to the ancient texts,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:27.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's said...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:29.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er started going to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:32.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,He still took his medicine on time every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:37.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,To dispel Ping'er's resentment,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:39.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I no longer need to use my spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It feels like a huge burden has been lifted off my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:46.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this mundane, ordinary life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:48.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Dao Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,has grown even more harmonious and insightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:53.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Life and Death Domain
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,seems to be undergoing a transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the road ahead is still shrouded in mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only wait quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:05.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for Sun Tai,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,he never truly gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:10.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's constantly finding new ways to try to lead Ping'er to cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:15.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,At birth, human nature is inherently good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:19.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Condense yin energy from the primordial dust
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:22.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and gather the corpse's soul in the Dantian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:25.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the great path of the Corpse Puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 years of springs and autumns
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,passed in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:50.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What must come
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:53.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,has finally arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.36,0:14:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take one more sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:12.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looking back over half a lifetime,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:15.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,the man in blue robes has grown old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:19.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,life has far more
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:21.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,disappointments
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,than satisfactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:28.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on the journey...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.76,0:15:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was the son of an Elder of the main branch of the Corpse Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.28,0:15:36.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,469)\fad(300,300)}Sun Tai\NYoung
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,a thousand years old Soul Transformation cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everyone said I was favored by the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,with a smooth path ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.08,0:15:53.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Tai,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.48,0:15:55.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,accept your miserable fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,In just a hundred years,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I became
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:09.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,a mere slave in the Allheaven Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:12.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,spat upon by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.20,0:16:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was outraged,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,always wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,which step had gone wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,in leading me to lose everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:39.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,In these last ten or so years of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I finally understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.48,0:16:46.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:51.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,among thousands of choices
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:57.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,simply walked toward my own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:00.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looking back now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,we only live once
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,so you should
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,sing when you gain and rest when you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.88,0:17:14.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sorrow and resentment are fleeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, for me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,all joys and sorrows,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.68,0:17:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,all grudges and loves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:27.31,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: reference to the ancient scripture Platform Sutra
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.16,0:17:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,are illusions in the Bodhi mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I dismiss them with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:33.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will fulfill
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.72,0:17:35.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Between Life and Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It turns out the difference was so fleeting after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:18:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Escort the coffin !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.56,0:19:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old Sun was all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,but at least he had his adopted grandson Ping'er to see him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:21.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,my carving isn't as good as Dad's.
Dialogue: -100,0:19:21.44,0:19:24.14,Grave,,0,0,0,,{\move(952,215,952,0)}Sun
Dialogue: -100,0:19:21.44,0:19:25.44,Grave,,0,0,0,,{\move(947,482,947,134)}Tai's
Dialogue: -100,0:19:21.44,0:19:25.44,Grave,,0,0,0,,{\move(951,737,954,395)}Tomb
Dialogue: -100,0:19:21.44,0:19:25.44,Grave,,0,0,0,,{\move(1149,747,1149,418)\fs35}Inscribed\N\Nby
Dialogue: -100,0:19:21.44,0:19:25.44,Grave,,0,0,0,,{\move(1151,840,1151,521)\fs35}his\N\Ngrandson
Dialogue: -100,0:19:21.44,0:19:25.44,Grave,,0,0,0,,{\move(1149,920,1149,569)\fs35}Wang
Dialogue: -100,0:19:21.44,0:19:25.44,Grave,,0,0,0,,{\move(1157,1000,1157,639)\fs35}Ping
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please don't be offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:25.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:27.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have collected your ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.32,0:19:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will not fail to do
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,what I promised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:38.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,19 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fallen Moon Village saw one generation off
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and welcomed another.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of the neighbors from back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,30% are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mortal's life
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is nothing more than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,almost 20 years have passed in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:57.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:20:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still remember how you looked when you first brought Ping'er here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now, you're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Zhou,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,thank you for all your trouble over these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:10.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The child has grown up,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.36,0:20:12.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's time to take him out
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:13.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:18.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I suppose my second daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:20.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,just wasn't meant to have that fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Ping,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:23.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:25.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will you come back ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:26.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I probably won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hate you, Wang Ping !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.44,0:20:33.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second sister !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take care !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brothers Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,take care !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.44,0:20:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take care !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:50.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,why are women always such a hassle ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Especially Zhou Ruotong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:55.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you like her ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just that when she cries,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.00,0:21:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It feels a bit uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.20,0:21:07.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,where are we going next ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.40,0:21:10.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, we'll see the mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:13.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and how they soar majestically,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:15.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,touching the heavens while reaching the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Like Qilian Peak ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll go see mountains higher than Qilian Peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,much farther away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:30.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Go ahead and take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:30.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}on the other side of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:28.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cycle of Life and Death
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,is like wisps of smoke and drifting clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:37.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}See if the wind is blowing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:37.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:43.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}A lush tree always grows
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:43.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}from a tender shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,gone without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have long learned
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:35.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,the many aspects of Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:39.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I have little experience
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,with the essence of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:50.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}That tree shields you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:50.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}from half of the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I thought the Life and Death reincarnation cycle was the ultimate reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:47.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,But Sun Tai's final words
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:49.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,made me realize
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:57.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}The scent of the herbs and the smoke
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:57.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)}have drifted away from the stove
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.20,0:21:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,that the Life and Death reincarnation cycle is merely the continuation of karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sow the cause, reap the effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:22:04.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}whose fire has warmed up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.44,0:22:04.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}half of your lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.56,0:21:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Effect arises from the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.64,0:22:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fate of all living beings is based on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:10.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I watch you smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:10.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}as you run back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:06.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And above the Life and Death Domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.32,0:22:09.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is still the great Dao of Karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:17.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}That cry, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.32,0:22:17.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}came out slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 19 years in Fallen Moon Village were a quiet living.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:24.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,400)}I’ve walked through this world with you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:24.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,400)}and listened to the joys and sorrows of the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Tai's matter is over
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,and karma is now clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:21.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The path ahead is becoming clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:31.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,400)}As I count the falling leaves, as spring warms,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:31.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,400)}another year has flown by.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I took Ping'er and left Fallen Moon Village
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:29.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,heading into the wider human world of mountains and seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:31.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let the mountains and rivers of heaven and earth
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:37.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,400)}If you were to travel alone through the mountains and rivers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.44,0:22:37.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,400)}for half your life as if attending a banquet,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,wash his soul clean
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reveal his true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.08,0:22:41.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}I would wait for you beneath the locust tree
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:47.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}with a warm bowl of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:23.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}A mountain is not a mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:23.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}it's a place to climb and gaze into the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:30.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}The landscape is lush
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:30.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}with blooming flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:37.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,600)}Water flows over the cliff
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.80,0:23:37.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.76,0:23:44.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}Who will the rain
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:44.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)}fall onto next ?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.64,0:23:50.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}The moon sees through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.64,0:23:50.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)}the traveler’s weathered eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.92,0:23:58.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}He has traveled through mountains and seas
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.72,0:23:58.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)}but longs for a moment of reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.40,0:24:04.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}The wind blows through the window
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:04.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)}stirring memories of days gone by filled with laughter and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:11.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}All I see are
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.32,0:24:11.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the joys and sorrows we've shared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.40,0:24:18.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,200)}I'll take you on a journey through the mortal world,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:18.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,200)}as autumn fades and spring returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.68,0:24:25.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}As the snow falls from the eaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:25.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}I hope this letter finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.72,0:24:32.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,200)}I’ll wait for you under the locust tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.88,0:24:32.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,200)}having weathered the storms of our journey so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:38.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}Looking back, the smell of the food
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:38.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,600)}hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.00,0:24:42.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.24,0:24:49.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,400)}I’ve walked through this world with you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.60,0:24:49.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,400)}and listened to the joys and sorrows of the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.44,0:24:56.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}As I count the falling leaves, as spring warms,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.72,0:24:56.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}another year has flown by.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.52,0:25:03.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}I’ll wait for you under the locust tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.96,0:25:03.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,600)}having weathered the storms of our journey so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.20,0:25:10.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}Looking back, the smell of the food
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.80,0:25:10.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.84,0:25:17.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.60,0:25:31.20,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(317,245)\fad(500,1000)\fs60}Traversing\Nthe mortal world
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.60,0:25:31.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(347,490)\fad(500,1000)\fs60}Lyrics: Su Qia & Zhun Wei\NComposer: Mao Liang\NSinger: Hu Xia
